{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=730 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably the cutest bakery simulation game of the year! Join our Discord to get playtest keys, contribute, and share your feedback to help us improve: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=664 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train your employees, research new recipes, expand your store, run advertisements, stock up on new baking equipment, fill the shelves with a variety of pastries and bread, and tastefully decorate your bakery. Your goal is to provide customers with unforgettable experiences every time they visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/a1e0002d7dba6644a6dff78d22254166.avif?t=1773817086\" width=1560 height=865 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are recruited by a gang member who initially planned for a money-laundering operation. However, as an ambitious manager, you see the potential for this bakery to thrive. Explore the neighborhood after the store closes: talk to neighbors and customers, assist them, and unlock their stories. You might find yourself deeply involved with the community and falling in love with this charming little bakery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/6aa7408fa5844c3753506f52bcbb736b.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/6aa7408fa5844c3753506f52bcbb736b.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/6aa7408fa5844c3753506f52bcbb736b.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attract special customers like a grumpy yet amusing old bird, or the adorable yet soulful puppies. These unique customers are not easy to lure in! Discover their preferences and cater to them. Whether it\u2019s the right ads, the perfect bakery products, or special decorations, make them feel welcome. As a reward, they\u2019ll display unique behaviors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/978282f016f7f6f538d7c425d080857f.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/978282f016f7f6f538d7c425d080857f.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/978282f016f7f6f538d7c425d080857f.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Although it\u2019s a management game, you\u2019ll have the chance to bake food yourself or select a deck of bakery cards to compete with gourmet enthusiasts. You can also host thematic festivals in the game periodically... More games under development!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552590?t=1773817086","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3552590?t=1773817086","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/0a72bbe7ae34e2e6babbd3efe16e1d1d86c755de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773817086","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/0a72bbe7ae34e2e6babbd3efe16e1d1d86c755de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773817086","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=730 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/bec7262379fc6984fd5553100ad4f4b7.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Probably the cutest bakery simulation game of the year! Join our Discord to get playtest keys, contribute, and share your feedback to help us improve: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.poster.avif?t=1773817086\" width=664 height=372 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.webm?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/7578b93f64c96ccaf8e246033acf0ff4.mp4?t=1773817086\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit and train your employees, research new recipes, expand your store, run advertisements, stock up on new baking equipment, fill the shelves with a variety of pastries and bread, and tastefully decorate your bakery. Your goal is to provide customers with unforgettable experiences every time they visit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552590/extras/a1e0002d7dba6644a6dff78d22254166.avif?t=1773817086\" width=1560 height=865 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are recruited by a gang member who initially planned for a money-laundering operation. However, as an ambitious manager, you see the potential for this bakery to thrive. Explore the neighborhood after the store closes: talk to neighbors and customers, assist them, and unlock their stories. You might find yourself deeply involved with the community and falling in love with this charming little bakery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sha